## What Did NOT Work / re-diagnosed (do NOT retry)

- **Item 1 genre fix = NO-OP.** `series.genre` for SS-S15 is ALREADY 'comedy' (agent hypothesized null — WRONG; verified via DB). So the E13 CREAD "no genre playbook" HALT is NOT unset genre — it's a **transient genre-resolution degradation** (`runner.ts:274-279` degrades genre→null on ANY error, silently disabling comedy skills). Don't set genre; don't gate the tripwire. Real risk = silent degradation.
- **E13 Mode-3 cascade** — E13 created in global default Mode 3 (not Mode 2); brief approval → Polina auto-cascaded brief→writer→script→critic→storyboard, NO casting, NO gates. Root: episodes inherit global mode + Mode-3 auto-approves. Fixed by E13→Mode 2.
- **Budget gate scoping** — gating ALL agents broke replay Scenario 2 (EXEC-PUB Mode 1). Fix: scope budget gate to `spec.governance === 'AGENT_RUN'` (skip PUBLISH). Don't gate publish.
- **MCP execute_sql denied** — use one-off `.mjs` with service role, run from webapp/, delete after.
- **Mode 2.5 not storable** (`governance_mode smallint CHECK 1..4`) — use Mode 2 (enforcement-identical strict).

